1. After working on this project, I definitely feel more more comfortable creating elements that can link to other sources outside of my own page, as I had not really had much expierence with that. 
2. I think my site is fairly easy to navigate, perhaps making some of the pages have less scrolling and fitting all of the info at the top could make it a bit easier to use. I struggled a bit with this project just with getting all of the elements to fit where I wanted, but overall I am happy with the result.
3. If I had one more week for this project, I would probobly just look for more information that could possibly be added to the site, as I am fairly happy with my styles/organization.
4. I think I am most proud of how this site looks a lot more cohesive when comparing the pages to my previous site, that was a lot more scattered. I also feel this site has a bit more of a clean/professional look as I tried to keep it simple with styling but still engaging with the images. 